            "text": "corner-to-corner (C2C)",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "c2c"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " construction: diagonal ch-4 blocks of three trebles that increase to the midpoint then decrease back to a single block. The diagonal lines are visible on the finished mat as a herringbone-like grid. Intermediate skill is needed to manage the increase and decrease turns correctly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
